; One palette per suit, in suits.png's order (spades, clubs, hearts, diamonds), then the back.
; A suit's colour 1 is the suit's own colour: its picture, the fill of its corner icon and the
; shadow behind its rank, so it stays light against the black numbers. Colour 2
; is a grey for the icon's outline. Colour 3, black, is the card's edge (corners included), the
; faces and the ranks. The back uses colour 0 for its card, colour 1 for its pattern and colour 3
; for its edge and the design in the middle; its colour 2 is the felt's green, set by the game.
; spades
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 00, 00, 00

; clubs
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 00, 00, 00

; hearts
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 30, 22, 24
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 00, 00, 00

; diamonds
	RGB 31, 31, 31
	RGB 30, 22, 24
	RGB 18, 18, 18
	RGB 00, 00, 00

; the back: Meowth's yellow and brown (the sidebar's light and dark colours), with a black edge and
; middle design. Colour 2 is the felt's green behind its corners: the game sets it, this one is a
; stand-in. (A sliding card shows colour 2 as white anyway.)
	RGB 30, 26, 16
	RGB 20, 14, 09
	RGB 10, 22, 12
	RGB 00, 00, 00
